WEBVTT

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:09.680
Yasumasa, bring Raiko here immediately.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.690
I apologize for my rudeness, but would it not be wise to call him

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.520
in the morning instead of the dead of night?

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.590
Time is of the essence.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:21.160
I will not say it again! Hurry!

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.530
Yes!

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.660
What is Michinaga-<i>sama</i> so afraid of?

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.580
Who goes there, so late at night?

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.380
Seimei-<i>dono</i>?

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:46.760
Perfect timing. I am on my way to visit Raiko-<i>dono.</i>

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.090
Raiko...

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:51.290
The Golden Knight?

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:54.230
You...

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:56.260
You are not Seimei.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.370
Kanehira, keep yourself hidden.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.700
Yes!

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.090
Yasumasa-<i>sama</i>!

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:35.000
Fujiwarano Yasumasa.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.170
He was a foolish man.

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:47.940
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:54.660
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:01:54.660 --> 00:02:00.300
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:05.430
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:10.060
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:17.650
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:22.880
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:28.890
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.890
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:34.000
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:39.200
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.840
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:54.840
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:02:55.350 --> 00:03:00.890
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.590
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:07.860
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:08.960
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:13.960
"DUEL"

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:28.850
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.520
Is it more of that red lightning?

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.040
Yeah.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.400
Silver Knight Zanga.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:54.240
I order you. Attack Seimei, who has become Rudra's vessel.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.250
Oh, that's right.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.980
I must give you this.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.990
Take this ball with you.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.830
You have lost to it once.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:16.930
As you are now, you do not have enough strength.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.270
We don't have any time to spare.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:21.140
This is...

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.570
A ball with Madou fire sealed within.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:27.340
Ask your Madou tool how to use it.

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:31.610
Our enemy is Seimei.

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:33.950
I won't force Raiko to cut her down.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.850
I have to be the one to do it.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.600
What has happened?!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:51.770
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.430
Yasumasa-<i>sama</i> has...

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.870
Yasumasa-<i>sama</i>!

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.940
Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>?!

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.530
Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>!

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:03.040
Who in the world...?

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:07.620
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>, actually...

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:13.150
No way. I cannot believe that Seimei-<i>san...</i>

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:17.110
I see. So she was the one who murdered my brother.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.400
Yasusuke-<i>dono.</i>

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:23.460
I currently have some troublesome business to attend to.

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:28.200
I thought I might as well come by to see my brother's face before I go...

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:32.840
Brother...

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:36.740
Brother!

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.820
Why?!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.100
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! Terrible news!

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.500
Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>... By Seimei!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.490
What?!

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:08.470
No way... I don't believe it.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:12.680
Where are you going?

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.520
I'm heading to the Watchdog Center.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.880
Huh?

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:17.750
Take care of Kaguya.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.620
Yasusuke should still be at the Watchdog Center.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:24.250
I have to inform him properly about what happened to Yasumasa-<i>dono.</i>

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:29.700
I see. Yasusuke has already left...

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.430
I ordered him to eliminate Seimei.

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:34.070
This happened because he dragged his feet.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:36.440
You ordered Yasusuke to defeat Seimei?!

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:38.610
But, Seimei is...

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:42.480
Seimei has even murdered Yasusuke's brother.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.110
Golden Knight.

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:50.390
If you do not fulfill your duty, more innocent people will die.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:52.790
There's no time for hesitation.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:55.660
The moon continues to grow redder.

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:59.130
The violence of the red lightning has also increased.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:02.130
The time of resurrection is already at hand.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:06.000
We should expect Rudra's resurrection at any moment.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.140
What will you do, Golden Knight?

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.330
Will you not cut Seimei down?

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:19.510
The Golden Knight is of no use, as expected.

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:20.750
Well, it's fine.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.620
I am sure the current
Silver Knight will be sure to do it.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.490
He will be able to cut her down.

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:29.260
His brother was murdered.
He cannot let that be forgiven.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:32.460
Such is human emotion.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.670
Come out.

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:47.040
I know that you're following me, Yasusuke.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:50.010
Did you think I was Seimei?

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:52.310
Why are you following me?

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:55.850
I've been watching you since you left your residence.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:59.220
Seimei is targeting you, after all.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:03.890
Was Seimei really the one who killed Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>?

00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:09.330
Sorry, Yasusuke.

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:12.000
If only I had brought
Seimei back to normal sooner.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.670
She won't return!

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.840
She is Rudra! She has to be cut down.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.340
No, you're wrong. Seimei is...!

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.430
Golden Knight.

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.880
Seimei.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:28.820
I've come to kill you.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:32.320
You were the one who killed Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.750
Yasumasa?

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:36.920
You shouldn't have had any resentment against Yasumasa-<i>dono</i>!

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:40.370
I do not bother remembering every bug that I squash.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.560
You bastard!

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.190
Wait, Yasusuke!

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:53.270
Yasusuke!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:55.840
Wait!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.380
Don't get in my way, Raiko!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.780
Right now, you are moving on emotion alone!

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:00.950
So what?!

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:04.190
No matter your enemy, if you fight with anger,

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.890
you may breed inner darkness!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.560
You may create an opening for a Horror to possess you.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.890
I don't care!

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:13.260
I will avenge my brother! For that...

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:15.630
I don't care who it is.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:20.230
I will kill anyone who gets in my way.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:23.200
I am your opponent!

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:32.910
Revenge for my brother.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:52.330
Hoh, interesting. Come.

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:54.600
Wait!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:55.930
I won't let you escape!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.020
So slow.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.340
Shit!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.620
He's lost himself with anger!

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:16.920
I know!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.810
Wait!

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.010
Don't get in my way!

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:51.990
Kaguya-<i>sama</i>! Where are you going?!

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:53.530
You mustn't!

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:55.520
Please wait!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.370
Listen to me, Yasusuke!

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.170
Seimei is still alive.

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:05.170
Even while surrounded by darkness, she's waiting for me to save her!

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.040
You're still saying such things?!

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.040
I won't let you escape!

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:23.390
I won't let you!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:24.690
Yasusuke!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:32.000
Raiko, Seimei has already turned to Rudra completely.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.040
There's nothing that you can do!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.770
No, you're wrong! Not yet!

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.710
Then why did she murder my brother?!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.240
Raiko! Open your eyes!

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:41.780
Seimei is gone!

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:44.080
No, she's still alive!

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.180
That's...!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.620
Raiko-<i>sama</i> and Yasusuke-<i>sama</i>!

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:49.240
Difference...

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:09.740
I believe in Seimei!

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:13.200
Then, there are no longer any words between you and I!

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.270
Revenge for my brother!

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:49.710
Seimei!

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:53.480
N-No way...

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:59.720
Brother, I've avenged you.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.440
What?!

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:35.790
You are...

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:39.530
You protected me?

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.440
Affection...

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:46.840
Huh?

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:50.500
Affection is not fixation.

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.650
What?!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:03.520
How dare you, Makai Knight.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.680
Seimei!

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.570
She regenerated?!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:14.450
I will kill both you and the Golden Knight...

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.670
I will have you retreat for now.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:18.970
Wait!

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:21.640
I'll have you give me back Seimei!

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:24.810
Seimei no longer exists.

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:27.840
Seimei is alive! I'm sure!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.650
So blinding. Such a straightforward gaze.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:37.350
Such brightness is what I hate most.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.720
Let go of Seimei!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.700
That light of yours.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:48.360
I shall extinguish it along with all the light of this world.

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:56.430
With the power of Rudra, who will soon resurrect!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.050
You realize it, don't you, Raiko?

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.620
It's already...

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:06.750
No, you don't know that.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:10.390
I can't allow you to cut down Seimei ever again!

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:15.050
Then, even if I have to defeat you...

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:26.870
Raiko-<i>sama</i>. Yasusuke-<i>sama.</i>

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.640
I'm going to fight seriously!

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:30.940
Understood!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:09.980
Difference is not hostility.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.240
Huh?

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:55.350
You win.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:17:02.700
I promise you. I will no longer lay a hand on her.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:06.300
In exchange, you have to shoulder everything!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.870
Don't allow any more casualties!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:10.570
Understand?

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:25.660
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:28.820
Let's go back, to our home.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.730
Brother.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:39.400
What's wrong, Yorinobu?

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:41.670
Michinaga-<i>sama</i> calls for you.

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:54.390
Do not worry.
The preparations are almost complete.

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:58.120
All that is left is the power of that person!

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:03.530
Raiko, I have a request.

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.460
It is something only a Makai Knight can do.

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.770
What is it?

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:11.260
Cut down Ashiya Douman.

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:13.900
My apologies!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.910
But I have heard that Makai Knights cannot cut down people!

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.140
That is correct!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.240
Makai Knights can only cut down Horrors,

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:23.250
those considered evil spirits!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:27.790
The red lightning attacking the capital these past few days

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:31.160
are probably the work of Douman.

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:34.320
I no longer believe it to be the act of a normal human.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:37.590
What problem is there in cutting such a creature down?

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:45.300
We are too short-handed here.
Kintou and Yasumasa are gone.

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:47.970
You will cut him down.

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:52.240
I will cut him down without question if he is a Horror.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:55.480
However, Makai Knights are ones who protect.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:58.020
They cannot move on a personal agenda.

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:03.990
Also, in my eyes, you and Douman are the same.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:06.960
R-Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:12.530
Is that so? I am the same as Douman in your eyes.

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:15.800
I see, you say interesting things.

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:19.940
You use people as pawns to achieve your own desires.

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:21.310
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.040
I see.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:28.210
However, to me, you and Douman are very similar.

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:32.880
Yin and Yang--if you flip them around, they are the same.

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:35.720
That is enough. Leave.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:49.300
The time of Rudra's awakening is close.

00:20:14.090 --> 00:20:18.560
That red lightning again.

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.220
So ominous.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.770
Sorry, Yorinobu.

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:25.370
Huh?

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:28.600
I may have put your position in danger.

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:33.610
Something like that does not matter.

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:36.580
I admire your attitude, Brother.

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:39.950
I will be wary of Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.520
Be careful.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:46.090
Also, um, Brother...

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:48.930
I know. It's all right.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:51.400
I will be sure to save Seimei.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:52.800
What of Yasusuke-<i>dono</i>?

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:56.100
After that, I have not heard from him...

00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.600
Did you call me suddenly for a lecture?

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.440
Silver Knight.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:06.310
The personal fight you had goes against the code of the knights.

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:07.480
Against the code.

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:09.880
Yeah, I know.

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:12.950
Our condolences about your older brother.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:16.250
So even you all can say things like that.

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:20.820
Goodness, what do you think we are?

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:22.330
Well, it's fine.

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:27.400
Silver Knight Zanga. No, Thief Hakamadare.

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:30.560
There is something we want you to steal.

00:21:33.840 --> 00:21:36.570
The preparations are complete.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:41.130
Inform Haruaki of this.

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:49.990
Yasusuke promised me he won't lay his hands on Seimei again.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.990
But, I'm sure his feelings have not been sorted.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.830
I see...

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:56.360
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:21:56.360 --> 00:21:58.120
Look!

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:14.810
Raiko!

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:16.970
The preparations are complete!

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:20.940
Bring Kaguya to my dwelling!

00:22:53.250 --> 00:23:01.190
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:11.280
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:18.340
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.340 --> 00:23:24.340
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:30.690
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.690 --> 00:23:35.790
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:42.430
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:47.630
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:23:50.950 --> 00:24:00.960
"Next Episode: RESONANCE"

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:54.200
The feelings are strong.

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:56.170
Light to the darkness.

00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:59.940
And the time of lamenting.
